{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "831e81dbcd0a1319684dae5fe9f027f17131f4cb2d59b890e6b9428f2be649b9", "ja": "気になるおたより", "zh": "令人在意的来信", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "fa55fc7cdbafbb7a4d2bc478a04e5ab8baca25e68117cdc15fc50d6bf0e4cb31", "ja": "番組宛てのおたよりの中に姉妹仲について\nの悩みを見つけたまつり。感じるものが\nあったせいか、やや気落ちしてしまう。\nそれに気付いたプロデューサーとこのみは、\nうまくフォローしていこうと話し合う。", "zh": "在寄给节目的来信中，まつり发现了一封烦恼于姐妹关系的来信。或许是因为有所触动，她的情绪变得有些低落。注意到这一点的制作人与このみ商量着要好好帮助她。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6b0b58a98036b4413f5b94a81976aca775bfbe53cb3342f951f0ad1e097d3e8a", "ja": "（初回配信は好評のうちに終わり、今日が2回目。\nこの後は、本番前の打ち合わせだ）", "zh": "（第一次直播在好评中结束，今天是第2次。接下来要进行正式开始前的讨论）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1001_021mat", "source_sha256": "1a9a3d64307f7f1a781a186fe8b78fa64cd12322427c4e073ead49310dc1614c", "ja": "姫のチェックによると……なんと！　この前の\nラジオ、SNSでトレンド入りしていたのです♪", "zh": "据公主的调查……竟然！上次的\n广播，在SNS上进入热门趋势了哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "9430b6000bc3c6bbcdd29f8304f9c249afa22af4b5a2a09d2f97351de6fb590e", "ja": "ええ、さっそくファンレターで感想が届いてたわ。\n好評だったみたいで、うれしいわね！", "zh": "是啊，粉丝来信已经迫不及待地寄来了感想。\n看来反响很不错，真让人高兴呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1003_p", "source_sha256": "62bd26d09a366ae188d1c46bbeaf5d708f5066779d86ce56007a27c8df8f55dc", "ja": "そうですね。でも、ふたりに相談したいリスナーは、\nまだまだ大勢いるみたいで……。", "zh": "是啊。不过，好像还有很多听众想向你们两位请教……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1004_null", "source_sha256": "775d652d6b7ce6af7fcd1b55ac8a70446845da20539b39eb282ae6024f0a67fb", "ja": "ドサッ！！", "zh": "啪嗒！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e48c7a737fd4b2d7e97f42f79dd4c3ec5c94576f8e601892f09fc483f56580f0", "ja": "このとおり、おたよりが山のように届いています！\nここから、今日取り上げる分を選ばないとでして……。", "zh": "如你所见，来信像山一样堆积起来了！\n接下来得从中选出今天要介绍的内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1006_039kon", "source_sha256": "aea0d18cd6994985a068521e3525b116b8681c064e1d7851df3c65be517dc279", "ja": "本当に山のようね……。\nでも、うれしい悲鳴だわ！　ね、まつりちゃん♪", "zh": "真的堆得像山一样呢……\n不过，这是幸福的烦恼！对吧，茉莉♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "03eef9b506a3f600142e26162af09b3a0805e97ce9a9bcd04e36aef70f577bab", "ja": "はいなのです♪　このみちゃんとまつりとで、\nおたよりを選んでいくのです！", "zh": "好哒♪ 小木实和小祭一起挑选来信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1008_p", "source_sha256": "1278e36c7a3620bce986313d2f722b6683941b562e394739bd418b89205f8fc6", "ja": "下読みは、予めしておいたから。\nよし、みんなでどれがいいか選んでいこう！", "zh": "我已经提前看过一遍了。\n好，大家一起选选看哪个比较好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1009_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7609d193f07a75fa9c3b8dc688d67de6944f3550bfb3296ba850738ccb2b5291", "ja": "これも恋愛相談か……。\n恋愛系のお悩みって、意外と多いんですね。", "zh": "这也是恋爱咨询吗……  \n恋爱方面的烦恼，意外地还真不少呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "75dd44a01ea98cd0c9d3c60ea9b4cbfcc71cec9149eef084ca4caa86364579d6", "ja": "そうみたい。\n恋ってやっぱり、普遍的な悩みなのね……。", "zh": "看来确实是这样。\n恋爱果然是永恒的烦恼呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1012_021mat", "source_sha256": "3abf779213677339c1cca900712838530ecdf26cdfa514d0849acb3b24f2b2f2", "ja": "{$P$}さん？\n真剣に読んであげないと、めっ！　なのですよ？", "zh": "{$P$}先生？\n要是不认真读给你听，可是会被说“不行”的哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1013_p", "source_sha256": "59d4d8a99a2cb8ca95e5b98d0fcfa1899b944f4ea2209d91ba81d9d04a9a4454", "ja": "もちろん、真剣に読んでるつもりだけど……\nわかった、さらに気を引き締めて読むよ。", "zh": "当然，我确实是认真在读的……\n知道了，我会再打起精神读下去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1014_039kon", "source_sha256": "668aacd9f5947d19bca11f3768a3c6bd285e31a00fff2d9e450e771d55fa2762", "ja": "とはいえ、恋愛相談ばかりじゃ偏りがあるわよね。\nリスナーのみんなも、飽きちゃうかもしれないし。", "zh": "话虽如此，如果全都是恋爱咨询，内容未免太单一了呢。\n听众们也可能会听腻的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1015_021mat", "source_sha256": "16668dca0b2eea58c6ee08f56afb6fc7a9ec348c88c32a8a34fe7f6a9e7b3ff3", "ja": "それは一理あるのです……。\n読みながら、別のお悩みも探してみるのです。", "zh": "确实有道理……  \n我会一边读，一边找找其他烦恼的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "8bc29724134b6b45e3e734e9ddb1a2339d393c5445e33b20cf066774b09666bb", "ja": "う～ん、これは……恋。こっちも、恋なのです。\nあ、このおたよりは……？", "zh": "嗯～这个是……恋爱。这个也是，恋爱呢。\n啊，这封来信是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1017_null", "source_sha256": "bcec22c0744a92f0c33824a501c786232d43ed6f33ca9b7eae03cd8f90f2e118", "ja": "「こんにちは。こういうおたよりは、\n初めて送ります。私の悩みを聞いてください」", "zh": "「你好。我是第一次寄这样的信。\n请听听我的烦恼」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1018_null", "source_sha256": "5e3944fa53d8a3072a9a9c870629d2e7fcf6c59eab059f8e4fd8448c37194748", "ja": "「私にはお姉ちゃんがいます。でも最近、\n姉と私は相性が悪いような気がしてきました」", "zh": "「我有一个姐姐。但是最近，\n我总觉得我和姐姐好像合不来」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1019_021mat", "source_sha256": "6fea0315b09da3ddc472b16fef2bec2497c049605f199a373b817aeb0d004c7d", "ja": "！　ほ……。", "zh": "！呃……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1020_null", "source_sha256": "128cc42dfedc91eba2fd474ff4e96f3f556532d455030ae6268c6575edc2d97d", "ja": "「顔を見ればケンカしてばっかりで、どうして\nそうなったのか、後になると理由も覚えていません」", "zh": "“一见面就总是吵架，至于为什么\n会变成这样，事后甚至连原因都想不起来”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1021_null", "source_sha256": "72b132b4f7e01d6c2ea163090761acb436a1ebc015557f636601c16a6aae43bf", "ja": "「本当は、ケンカなんかしたくないです。\n親に相談しても、深刻に受け取ってもらえなくて……」", "zh": "“其实，我一点也不想吵架。\n就算找父母商量，他们也完全不当回事……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1023_039kon", "source_sha256": "335dbb24d10a3b41f789408696d3e1bea33e998c702063dd962efde503d264a2", "ja": "ええ。そうね、それがいいんじゃないかしら。\nまつりちゃんも、それでいい？", "zh": "嗯，是啊，我觉得这样不是挺好的吗？\n小祭，这样可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "f46a7651e06bacd44238260a6cad3ac732103ed8ea99954cbd1ef4cdec2a1316", "ja": "……まつりちゃん？　どうかした？", "zh": "……小祭？怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1026_021mat", "source_sha256": "921970fd4b4be7a2616523e4b337d635c3cb5c5321e179bc8b924b29962ad58a", "ja": "え？　あっ、ごめんなさい。\n姫、おたよりに集中してしまっていたのです。", "zh": "诶？啊，抱歉。\n公主刚才太专注于回信了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1027_p", "source_sha256": "ed287992704442358f7e2d2e52eb6fcffa727feeacd4d51de5dfe9e0bd853a05", "ja": "そうか。いや、流石におたよりの数が多いから、\n半分は次回にまわそうかって相談してたんだ。", "zh": "这样啊。没事，毕竟来信数量太多了，所以我们刚才在商量要不要把一半留到下次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1028_021mat", "source_sha256": "f6f0db9225d9bdd0e675ccef2e5b802ab6685a26ad9805aebf1a20e6c5aae74c", "ja": "次回に……わかりました。\n姫も、それでいいのです。", "zh": "下次……明白了。小姬也觉得这样就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1029_p", "source_sha256": "36512fc4769f83a42cfb50a8b7e8df58d0a495e3f042c7bd467a4ae8fe7cf94d", "ja": "まつり、どうかしたのか？\n……そのおたよりが、何か気になるのか？", "zh": "茉莉，怎么了吗？\n……那封来信，是有什么让你在意的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1030_021mat", "source_sha256": "3f30a6376073d3acd76e3010679e37f2259ccdeb513643b9887ac3bbdf1673e8", "ja": "えっ。あ、その、なんでもないのです！\n姫、あまり数が読めなかっただけなのです。", "zh": "诶。啊，那个，没什么啦！\n只是姬没能读多少而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1031_p", "source_sha256": "8e1d77d87ad9ed329755069d294d704a02d0ccc488a8cee5f97d6edce92d4d92", "ja": "数が多いからな。ひとつひとつの相談と\n真剣に向き合うには、時間も必要だし……。", "zh": "数量太多了嘛。要想认真面对\n每一个商量，也是需要时间的……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "379b34e3219194b6efa31be367a4918c3831d9ba40b6d29995988a362719b7de", "ja": "それだけ、まつりちゃんが真剣だった証拠ね。\n安心して、こっちの山は私が担当するから！", "zh": "这正说明小祭是多么认真呢。\n放心吧，这边的工作就交给我！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1033_021mat", "source_sha256": "c87fad5737be8592b0e6db36dc83695c6ab4dad9f0cc275906ef6f93975a9c43", "ja": "はいなのです。\nこのみちゃん、よろしくお願いするのです。", "zh": "好的哦。\n小此，我们就拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1034_p", "source_sha256": "7504da4e1c4ab20a900efa3c6f606eeefa685c483d646408676a763e96b039b9", "ja": "少し休憩を挟んでから、台本の最終チェック。\nその後に本番だ。ふたりとも、頑張ろう！", "zh": "稍微休息一下之后，再做一次台本的最终检查。\n在那之后就是正式开拍了。你们两个，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1035_039kon", "source_sha256": "2df36b34dd6bcf9447ba44fd19651899046ba39c1d862a1ce50616abc6f726a3", "ja": "ええ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1036_021mat", "source_sha256": "84fec0b04b4f4bc30492ba3d22838f0ebbfbf474add6410aae38a6fe7339d053", "ja": "はいなのです！", "zh": "好的喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1037_null", "source_sha256": "94f8a2b816a22ea87fffa95625de54ee3c2f93f52d142438f73fb3374372bfce", "ja": "第2回配信　終了後……", "zh": "第2次直播结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1038_p", "source_sha256": "855f3d931592c5443cce4310d5ef5d1bdae50183d038965f634c54f07c3bd45d", "ja": "（第2回配信は、全部の数字が初回を上回った！\nこれは、かなり話題になっていると言っていい……）", "zh": "（第2次直播，所有数字都超过了第一次！\n可以说，这已经引起相当大的话题了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1039_p", "source_sha256": "06e5b7203024ed62ce5d456349a0b50d78ff1343cce91260410076e9d6b73692", "ja": "（しかし、まつりが少し、元気がないように\n見えたのが気になるな。後で話を……ん？）", "zh": "（不过，总觉得茉莉好像有点没精神。这让我有些在意。待会儿找她聊聊……嗯？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1040_039kon", "source_sha256": "e60949ac17afecfb66de45214cdbdffa58174528a339e8bce66e712710b7105f", "ja": "そっか……。まつりちゃんが読んでいたのは、\nこのおたよりだったのね……。", "zh": "这样啊……原来小祭读的是这封来信啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1041_p", "source_sha256": "101247fd94cae22f2a017743b4f67ac9af8d6f192b9197497d2e6b042c0a544f", "ja": "お疲れさまです、このみさん。\nこんな時間に、どうかしたんですか？", "zh": "辛苦了，木实。\n这么晚了，有什么事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "16b88dc3609f385163b79ce37ab5d5a1fda16216d05077aa15493e86748a5ef8", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。今、まつりちゃんが\n昼間読んでいたおたよりを見つけたんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。我刚刚发现了小祭白天读过的来信……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1043_p", "source_sha256": "a85316cffefaa14b3295cf59a34bf05087d0606749414a78412c6262687d0c0d", "ja": "なるほど。少し元気がないように感じたんですが……\n姉妹仲の悩みのおたよりか……。", "zh": "这样啊。我感觉她好像有点没精神……原来是烦恼姐妹关系的来信啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "4d74bb7b6f6da4120490af34376d7aa3723378483d5fd6aa1e4878490c480984", "ja": "まつりちゃん、たしか妹さんとは、\nあまり仲が良くないって言ってたわよね……？", "zh": "茉莉，我记得你好像说过，\n跟妹妹的关系不太好吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1045_039kon", "source_sha256": "9812de5cf54363ddc90b8bca0fed07377d4c0833f75a2bdd12bf10296ff87baf", "ja": "だからこのおたよりは、私が回答したほうが\nいいんじゃないかって思ったんだけど。", "zh": "所以我觉得，这封来信还是由我来回答比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1046_p", "source_sha256": "738181eb8bfbb481326e835bfa0ae59ebe5647134ea4cc9f02af1667ac9705d6", "ja": "そうですね……とはいえ、まつりも\nこのおたよりを気にしているみたいですし。", "zh": "是啊……不过，茉莉好像也很在意这封来信。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "26c9f848b6d5ffb3e5ef1d91731e7023f5f499c50c17da4d7da765820e7cbb45", "ja": "本人とも相談して、それで決めましょうか。", "zh": "和本人商量一下，再决定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0265_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0265_story_03_1048_039kon", "source_sha256": "29e52bf6995b0d268be2ba223a2b546dde83bba0e0948ee630917e78d823e39f", "ja": "ええ、そうしましょう！　上手にフォローして\nあげられるといいんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，就这么办吧！要是能好好帮上忙就好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
